  <h2>What you're submitting today</h2>
  <p class="sub">Your diagram plus one reservoir, one residence time, one stakeholder. Specificity is the bar.</p>
  <div class="submission-callout">
    <div class="label">Exit ticket: reservoir + residence time + stakeholder</div>
    <p>Three things: (1) name a reservoir the Cauvery depends on · (2) give its approximate residence time · (3) name one group whose water depends on that reservoir, and say what happens to them if it is used faster than it refills. Generic ("groundwater" / "long" / "farmers") does not clear the bar. For example: "The shallow groundwater under the Cauvery delta refills over years to decades. Delta rice farmers pump it in the dry months when the river runs low. If they pump faster than the monsoon refills it, the water table drops, and near the coast seawater moves in, which is much harder to reverse."</p>
